1->
While loop-
Syntax:
while (condition)
{
    //code
}

2->
Do-While loop-
Syntax:
do
{
    //code
} while (condition);

3->
For loop-
Syntax:
for (size_t i = 0; i < count; i++)
{
    //code
}

4->
Break statement-
Syntax:
break;
-Used for break the statement.

5->
Continue statement-
Syntax:
continue;
-Used for skip the iteration.

